THIRD-PARTY NOTICE: Siekoo 7-Segment Font

The files `components/uc8119/siekoo.h` and `esp-idf-driver/siekoo.h` contain
the Siekoo alphabet by Alexander Fakoó (https://fakoo.de/en/siekoo.html).

The Siekoo font is licensed under:
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives (CC BY-NC-ND)
  Copyright (c) Alexander Fakoó

This means the Siekoo font files:
  - Require attribution to Alexander Fakoó
  - May NOT be used for commercial purposes
  - May NOT be modified or distributed in altered form

The Siekoo font is OPTIONAL. The driver and display components work without it
by setting `font: classic` in the ESPHome configuration. Removing the siekoo.h
files does not affect driver functionality.

